orvegicus", "R. norvegicus", "Rn", "brown rat", "Norway rat"], "taxId": "10116", "abbreviation": "RNO", "className": "Species", "schemaClass": "Species"}], "category": "transition", "className": "Reaction", "schemaClass": "Reaction"}, {"dbId": 10009959, "displayName": "Activated AKT phosphorylates AKT1S1 (PRAS40)", "stId": "R-MMU-377186", "stIdVersion": "R-MMU-377186.1", "isInDisease": false, "isInferred": true, "maxDepth": 1, "name": ["Activated AKT phosphorylates AKT1S1 (PRAS40)"], "releaseDate": "2026-03-25", "speciesName": "Mus musculus", "inferredFrom": [377186], "species": [{"dbId": 48892, "displayName": "Mus musculus", "name": ["Mus musculus", "M. musculus", "Mm", "house mouse"], "taxId": "10090", "abbreviation": "MMU", "className": "Species", "schemaClass": "Species"}], "category": "transition", "className": "Reaction", "schemaClass": "Reaction"}], "reviewed": [{"dbId": 5693188, "displayName": "Zwartkruis, Fried J T, 2015-05-14", "dateTime": "2015-05-14 18:29:12", "className": "InstanceEdit", "schemaClass": "InstanceEdit"}], "revised": [{"dbId": 9975701, "displayName": "Orlic-Milacic, Marija, 2025-12-02", "dateTime": "2025-12-02 00:22:35", "className": "InstanceEdit", "schemaClass": "InstanceEdit"}, {"dbId": 5687545, "displayName": "Jupe, Steve, 2015-04-08", "dateTime": "2015-04-08 12:11:40", "className": "InstanceEdit", "schemaClass": "InstanceEdit"}], "species": [48887], "summation": [{"dbId": 376995, "displayName": "<p>AKT1 phosphorylates AKT1S1 (PRAS40, Proline Rich Akt Subs...", "text": "<p>AKT1 phosphorylates AKT1S1 (PRAS40, Proline Rich Akt Substrate 40 kDa) at Thr-246 (Kovacina et al. 2003; Sancak et al. 2007; Oshiro et al. 2007; Vander Haar et al. 2007; Wang et al. 2008; Mi et al. 2015). AKT1S1 is an inhibitory accessory protein of mTORC1. Phosphorylation of AKT1S1 by AKT releases the inhibition of mTORC1.</p><p>Mice engineered to express AKT1S1 T246A mutant in the basal keratinocytes of epidermis are resistant to epidermal tumorigenesis induced by the treatment with the tumor promoter TPA (12-O-tetradecanoyl-phorbol-13-acetate) and show persistent association of AKT1S1 T246A with the mTORC1 complex, even under mTOR signaling activating conditions (Rho et al. 2016).</p><p>AKT2 also phosphorylates AKT1S1 (Kovacina et al. 2003; Quambusch et al. 2021), as does AKT3 (Madhunapantula et al. 2007; Sun et al. 2020).</p>", "literatureReference": [9975654, 377225, 377103, 9975665, 200154, 9975231, 200166, 377264, {"dbId": 9975229, "displayName": "Overexpression of PRAS40(T246A) in the Proliferative Compartment Suppresses mTORC1 Signaling, Keratinocyte Migration, and Skin Tumor Development", "title": "Overexpression of PRAS40(T246A) in the Proliferative Compartment Suppresses mTORC1 Signaling, Keratinocyte Migration, and Skin Tumor Development", "journal": "J Invest Dermatol", "pages": "2070-2079", "pubMedIdentifier": 27349859, "volume": 136, "year": 2016, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/27349859", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}], "className": "Summation", "schemaClass": "Summation"}], "reviewStatus": {"dbId": 9821385, "displayName": "four stars", "definition": "structure upated after externally reviewed and then internally reviewed", "name": ["four stars"], "className": "ReviewStatus", "schemaClass": "ReviewStatus"}, "previousReviewStatus": {"dbId": 9821384, "displayName": "two stars", "definition": "structure updated after externally and internally reviewed", "name": ["two stars"], "className": "ReviewStatus", "schemaClass": "ReviewStatus"}, "updateTrackers": [{"dbId": 9984712, "displayName": "Update Tracker - [Reaction:377186] Activated Akt1 phosphorylates AKT1S1 (PRAS40) - v96:[add_removeCatalystActivity, add_removeOutput, modifyText, removeLiteratureReference]", "action": ["add_removeCatalystActivity", "add_removeOutput", "modifyText", "removeLiteratureReference"], "updatedInstance": [377186], "className": "UpdateTracker", "schemaClass": "UpdateTracker"}], "categ